   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the lobby, the paramedic explains that severe overeating triggered the prefect's collapse. After Eleonora berates Mikhail for risking a man's life over a bet, Barinov hands Mikhail a fresh two-kilogram steak to eat himself.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
